# Cron Configuration

## Every Hour

```cron
0 * * * * cd /opt/meshtastic-announcer && /usr/bin/python3 announce.py
```

## Every 30 Minutes

```cron
*/30 * * * * cd /opt/meshtastic-announcer && /usr/bin/python3 announce.py
```

## Daily Status Beacon

```cron
0 7 * * * cd /opt/meshtastic-announcer && /usr/bin/python3 announce.py
```

---

# State Change Detection

When enabled:

```yaml
send_only_on_change: true
```

The script compares the current mesh state against the previous execution.

Current tracked values:

- NODE_COUNT
- DIRECT_COUNT
- BATTERY
- TOP_NEIGHBOR
- BEST_SNR

If no change is detected, no transmission occurs.

This helps minimize unnecessary airtime usage.

