# Custom Tokens

Custom tokens may be defined in:

```yaml
custom:
  SITE_NAME: "Nebuchadnezzar"
  NODE_ROLE: "North Gateway"
  CONTACT: "@francis"
```

Template usage:

```text
Location: {SITE_NAME}
Role: {NODE_ROLE}
Contact: {CONTACT}
```

No code modifications are required.

---

# Available Tokens

## Node Information

| Token | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `{LONG_NAME}` | Node long name |
| `{SHORT_NAME}` | Node short name |
| `{LOCAL_NODE_ID}` | Node ID |
| `{LOCAL_NODE_NUM}` | Node numeric ID |
| `{HW_MODEL}` | Hardware model |
| `{FIRMWARE}` | Firmware version |

---

## Mesh Statistics

| Token | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `{NODE_COUNT}` | Total nodes |
| `{DIRECT_COUNT}` | Direct nodes |
| `{ONE_HOP_COUNT}` | One-hop nodes |
| `{TWO_HOP_COUNT}` | Two-hop nodes |
| `{THREE_PLUS_HOP_COUNT}` | Three-plus-hop nodes |
| `{NODES_SEEN_1H}` | Nodes heard within the last hour |
| `{NODES_SEEN_24H}` | Nodes heard within the last 24 hours |
| `{STALE_NODE_COUNT}` | Nodes with a valid last-heard time at least 24 hours ago |
| `{LOW_BATTERY_COUNT}` | Nodes reporting battery at or below 20% |

---

## RF Metrics

| Token | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `{CHANNEL_UTIL}` | Channel utilization |
| `{AIRTX}` | Air utilization TX |
| `{AVERAGE_SNR}` | Mesh average SNR |
| `{AVERAGE_RSSI}` | Mesh average RSSI |
| `{BEST_SNR}` | Best direct-node SNR |
| `{TOP_NEIGHBOR}` | Strongest direct node |

---

## Device Metrics

| Token | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `{BATTERY}` | Battery percentage |
| `{VOLTAGE}` | Voltage |
| `{UPTIME}` | Device uptime, formatted as days, hours, and minutes; `N/A` if unavailable |

---

## GPS

| Token | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `{POSITION}` | Latitude / Longitude |
| `{LATITUDE}` | Latitude |
| `{LONGITUDE}` | Longitude |
| `{ALTITUDE}` | Altitude in meters (`metric`) or feet (`imperial`) |
| `{GPS_LOCK}` | GPS lock status |
| `{GPS_SATELLITES}` | Satellites in view, when reported |
| `{GROUND_SPEED}` | Ground speed in km/h (`metric`) or mph (`imperial`), when reported |

Environmental tokens are populated when the local node's data includes
environment metrics; otherwise they render as `N/A`.

| Token | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `{TEMPERATURE}` | Temperature in °C (`metric`) or °F (`imperial`), when reported |
| `{RELATIVE_HUMIDITY}` | Relative humidity percentage, when reported |
| `{BAROMETRIC_PRESSURE}` | Pressure in hPa, regardless of selected unit system |

---

## Channel Information

| Token | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `{PRIMARY_CHANNEL}` | Channel index currently being sent to |
| `{CHANNEL_NAME}` | Channel display name |
| `{CHANNEL_INDEX}` | Channel index currently being sent to |

---

## Activity Information

| Token | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `{LAST_HEARD_NODE}` | Most recently heard node |
| `{LAST_HEARD_TIME}` | Most recent node's last-heard timestamp |
| `{LAST_HEARD_AGE}` | Time elapsed since the most recent node was heard; this value alone does not trigger `send_only_on_change` |
| `{TIME}` | Current script time |

---

## Warning Tokens

| Token | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `{AIRTIME_WARNING}` | OK / HIGH |
| `{UTILIZATION_WARNING}` | OK / HIGH |

---

## Reserved Future Tokens

These currently return placeholder values and are intended for future expansion.

| Token | Status |
|---------|---------|
| `{REGION}` | Reserved |
| `{MQTT_STATUS}` | Reserved |
