# Disclaimer

Use responsibly on shared Meshtastic networks.

Frequent automated announcements can consume airtime and increase channel congestion. Consider enabling `send_only_on_change` and scheduling announcements at reasonable intervals.

Recommended minimum schedule:

```cron
0 * * * *
```

or

```cron
*/30 * * * *
```

Avoid excessive transmission intervals unless operating on a private mesh.

